sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant RD as run-debate
    participant LA as lead-agent
    participant SA as Specialist Agents<br/>(roster 3–6)
    participant SR as score-round
    participant MA as meta-agent
    participant WR as write-report
    participant FS as File System

    User->>RD: /run-debate [slug]
    RD->>FS: Read ideas/{slug}/README.md
    FS-->>RD: idea + current scores
    RD->>LA: /lead-agent [slug]
    LA->>FS: Read idea + readiness scores
    LA-->>RD: JSON roster ["agent-skeptic","agent-tech-lead",...]

    loop For each round (max 4)
        RD->>RD: Print round header

        loop For each specialist in roster
            RD->>FS: Read agent MEMORY.md (if exists)
            FS-->>RD: agent memory (or empty)
            RD->>SA: /agent-{name} with idea context + prior round messages + memory
            SA-->>RD: specialist analysis (250–400 words)
            RD->>RD: Append to round messages list
        end

        RD->>SR: /score-round (slug, round messages, current scores)
        SR->>FS: Read ideas/{slug}/README.md
        SR->>MA: /meta-agent (idea + previous scores + round messages)
        MA-->>SR: JSON {scores, synthesis, open_questions, best_answers}
        SR-->>RD: updated scores, %, synthesis, questions

        RD->>FS: Update ideas/{slug}/README.md (scores + questions)
        RD->>RD: Print milestone update

        alt readiness >= 85%
            RD->>RD: Terminate — reason: target_reached
        else rounds == max
            RD->>RD: Terminate — reason: max_rounds
        end
    end

    RD->>WR: /write-report (session data)
    WR->>FS: Write ideas/{slug}/sessions/{slug}-session-{n}-{date}.md
    WR-->>RD: filename

    RD->>FS: Update Session History in README.md
    RD->>FS: Update ideas_index.md

    loop For each specialist in roster
        RD->>SA: /agent-{name} MODE:memory-update (contributions + synthesis)
        SA-->>RD: Updated MEMORY.md content
        RD->>FS: Write .claude/skills/{agent}/MEMORY.md
    end

    RD-->>User: Session complete summary
